tyle=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Legendary_Might_of_the_Abishai\" title=\"Named item sets\">Legendary Might of the Abishai</a>:</b> 3 Piece Equipped:<br />+20 Profane bonus to PRR and MRR<br />+10 Profane bonus to Natural Armor<br />+2 Profane bonus to all Ability Scores<br />+2 Profane bonus to DCs<br />+10 Profane bonus to Heal Amp (all types)<br />5 Piece Equipped:<br />+30 Profane bonus to PRR and MRR<br />+10 Profane bonus to Natural Armor<br />+3 Profane bonus to all Ability Scores<br />+3 Profane bonus to DCs<br />+30 Profane bonus to Heal Amp (all types)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Perfected_Charged_Gauntlets.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Perfected_Charged_Gauntlets.png/420px-Perfected_Charged_Gauntlets.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"736\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Perfected_Charged_Gauntlets.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>These gloves channel powerful electric energy into enemies that you strike.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>This <a href=\"/page/Minor_Artifact\" title=\"Minor Artifact\">Minor Artifact</a> has a maximum of 4 filigree slots.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816160105\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.103 seconds